    "description": {
        "": "Creates a parametric 3/16 in Ktech template bracket: kicked-out gooseneck tab with one 1/2 in hole, two 21/32 in clearance holes (for 5/8 bolts, 1.000 in C-C measured from the mating bracket), and DXF face export for laser or waterjet. Tab location is a sketch estimate from pencil on the 1:1 print."
